v 3
d mdfgen — code-generation layer for the Master DO File survey pipeline
d
d Writes the pipeline DO files that a Master DO File project runs:
d 00_Directory.do, 00a_Bootstrap.do, 00b_Local_Overrides.do, the
d labeling / translation / audio / finalise / core-variable modules,
d the project HFC DO and the Processing DO.
d
d Requires: Stata 16 or newer.
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260901
d Author: Adin Khan
d Support: https://github.com/adinkhan7/master-do-file
f mdfgen.ado
f _mdfgen_defs.ado
f mdfgen.sthlp
